{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43329","headline":"试越裳贡白雉 · 王若岩","name":"试越裳贡白雉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"素翟宛昭彰，遥遥自越裳。\n冰晴朝映日，玉羽夜含霜。\n岁月三年远，山川九泽长。\n来从碧海路，入见白云乡。\n作瑞兴周后，登歌美汉皇。\n朝天资孝理，惠化且无疆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王若岩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43329.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43329","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}